// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
//
// Crucible's icon, inside crucible.exe: what Explorer shows for the file, what
// the taskbar shows for the running window, and what the window wears in its
// corner. Without it all three are Windows' blank program icon, whatever the
// Start menu's shortcut says.
//
// 32512 is IDI_APPLICATION, which is the id the webview asks its own program
// for when it makes the window, and so the one that reaches the window too.
//
// Configured by CMake with the icon's full path, because the resource compiler
// looks for the file from wherever the build runs it rather than from beside
// this one.
32512 ICON "@CRUCIBLE_ICON_ICO@"
